    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> <strong>Necrotic Resilience:</strong> Resistance to Necrotic (Immunity while in Form of Dread - the module adds it). <strong>Unholy Resuscitation:</strong> when you drop to 0 HP and don't die outright, the module offers it: chosen creatures within 30 ft make a CON save (your spell DC) - 2d10 + CHA Necrotic, half on a success - your HP become twice your Warlock level, and you gain 1 Exhaustion level. Once per Short or Long Rest.</p>",
